  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">저희는 소규모로 전면등교중입니다~<br>현미경으로 수업하고 있는데<br>아래처럼 동그라미 부분이 제대로 안 나오네요.<br>1. 예쁘게 찍는 요령이 있을까요?<br><br>2. 눈썹이 보인다며 현미경을 못 보는 아이들에게 뭐라고 알려줘야할까요?</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b664364fdc8fa58502cbb2ce273a9fe6445bf59b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b664364fdc8fa58502cbb2ce273a9fe6445bf59b\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/466f715be805edbd90d1604c2856f7a8ca9c7105\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/466f715be805edbd90d1604c2856f7a8ca9c7105\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
